    "summary": "Partial review only. The packet diff was truncated, and the T-1519 worktree and branch no longer exist. The base commit 8429574 is the tip of task/T-1504, so the fix-round diff could not be recovered. I could not read the test bodies and could not run the tests (my last command failed because `timeout` is missing on this machine). What I did check: all seven acceptance-named tests are defined as methods in the right files on task/T-1504, and the packet's gate section shows gate_attempts 1, gate_reds 0 and a first_green_at timestamp. The visible capacity.py hunk adds `from . import executor as executor_module`, and that import creates no cycle: executor.py and pool.py do not import capacity. The visible hunk does not touch gitutil.py or tests/test_gitutil.py. The semantics of the seven tests (patched time.time and Pool.pick raising, bounded requeue counters, claim reset) are unverified, so this approval rests on the green gate.",
